<title>USA: Crown Vantage sees Q2 improved pricing.</title>
<headline>Crown Vantage sees Q2 improved pricing.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, Calif. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Vantage Inc, which reported a first quarter net loss of $9.6 million or $1.10 per share, said it is well positioned for recovery, with strong backlogs and some improvement in pricing being realized during this second quarter.</p>
<p>It said prices for printing and publishing papers industry wide appeared to hit their cyclical lows in the first quarter.</p>
</text>
